        <h1>How Good Is Your AI Knowledge, <em>Really?</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">Most people rate their AI skills higher than they can prove. Here is what AI literacy actually involves, the gap between feeling fluent and being fluent, the three levels of AI users, and how to see where you really stand.</p>
        <div class="byline"><span><b>Best Answer Hub</b></span><span>~11 min read</span><span>Evidence-based</span><span>No signup</span></div>
