          <li>GCheck, <a href="https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/05/19/3297597/0/en/63-of-Workers-Admit-to-Exaggerating-AI-Skills-as-Automation-Anxiety-Fuels-an-AI-Skills-Bubble-New-GCheck-Report-Finds.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Automation Anxiety Report</a>, 2026 (survey of 1,500 US workers; commercial survey).</li>
